<title>USA: ABN AMRO wins Illinois $60 mln sales tax bonds.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO wins Illinois $60 mln sales tax bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Securities said it won $60 million of Build Illinois sales tax revenue bonds, Series X, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.40 percent.</p>
</text>
